      "A_open_plan_bike": "plan ONCE on the real latent, track the frozen plan open-loop (REF-C-style single-shot; predictor NEVER stepped)",
      "B_closed_bike": "re-plan every 0.1 s on the model's OWN imagined latent (imagination-in-the-loop; the harness headline closed loop)",
